## Verdict on the preregistered question

Work per energy under Omni against native: 53.69 -> 53.29 served requests per kJ, difference -0.3977 (95% interval -1.04 to +0.2447).
Guardrails: requests served held (not below -1%), 95th-percentile response time held (not above +10%), requests not served held (not above +1% of native served).
Observation (watch against native) on the same outcome: power given, not beyond the noise. Authority (omni against watch): STEADY, under the floor.
**Result, by rule: STEADY (inside the noise, within the guardrails).**

